# Host deploy artifacts. deploy/install.py unpacks releases into the install
# root and points `current` at the live one, and on this host the install root
# is a checkout of this repository — so 20MB of release bundles land beside the
# corpus, untracked and one `git add -A` away from being committed.
/current
/releases/
/support/
/.tool-pack-root.json

